 3888 元的「供养套餐」。被害人 50 余人，追回赃款 200 余万元，主犯判有期徒刑十一年，并处罚金 10 万元"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原始出处"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Forer BR (1949). The fallacy of personal validation: A classroom demonstration of gullibility. Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology 44(1):118-123（表 1 评分分布：2 分 1 人、3 分 4 人、4 分 18 人、5 分 16 人，N=39）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1037/h0059240","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1037/h0059240"]},"；Carlson S (1985). A double-blind test of astrology. Nature 318:419-425（表 2：首选 116 份，挑中 40 份，随机期望 38.5，占星师预计 58.5；「The data are consistent with chance, inconsistent with astrological hypothesis」）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1038/318419a0","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1038/318419a0"]},"，第二作者主页全文 ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://muller.lbl.gov/papers/Astrology-Carlson.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://muller.lbl.gov/papers/Astrology-Carlson.pdf"]},"；最高人民检察院 (2026). 河南息县：历经三年持续追踪打掉一批网络算命诈骗团伙. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/zdgz/202607/t20260728_732935.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/zdgz/202607/t20260728_732935.shtml"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1037/h0059240","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["打开来源链接"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["这两篇都只是单独的一项研究。Forer 那篇原文没有直接写平均分，4.26 是按原文表 1 的分布算出来的。这里只说「它预测不准」，不评价任何信仰。当娱乐花几十块钱不算在内，拿它来定辞职、结婚、投资才是亏钱的地方。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/06-14"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"不要为了凑够「每天 8 杯水」强迫自己喝水"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/06-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"不要买防蓝光眼镜来「保护视力」，也不要相信「对着屏幕干几个月眼睛就废了」，但眼睛胀痛发红要当急症"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-11"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要在没有肠道问题时长期吃益生菌"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["45 项在健康成年人身上做的试验合起来看，吃益生菌不能让肠道里的菌长期变个样，停了就回到原样，血脂也没有改善。吃抗生素吃出腹泻这类特定情况…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-12"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要为了「增强免疫力」逼自己洗冷水澡"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["3018 人的试验里，洗冷水澡的人请病假的次数少了 29%，但请假的总天数和别人一样，所以谈不上少生病。2025 年把 11 项试验合起来…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-13"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要买排毒、清肠、酵素、碱性水这类产品"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["排毒这个产业做得很大，可支持它的临床证据非常少，也没人拿市面上卖的排毒饮食认真做过试验。有人去查饮食酸碱、碱性水和癌症有没有关系，够格的研…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-17"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要把献血当保健：「排毒、降血脂、防心梗」没有随机试验支持，频繁献倒是真会缺铁"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["说献血能排毒、降血脂、防心梗，靠不住。能一直去献血的人，本来身体就更好，把这层扣掉，每年多献一次血的死亡率降幅从近两成缩到 7.5%。真正…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-18"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要靠通用体检套餐防病，按年龄性别做那几项有证据的筛查"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["定期做通用健康检查的人，和不做的人死亡率一样，死于心血管病、癌症的也一样多。按年龄性别做那几项有证据的筛查就够了。35 岁以上每年能免费量…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-19"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要因为体检查出尿酸高、但从没痛过，就开始吃降尿酸药"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["尿酸超标、但从没发作过痛风也没长痛风石的人，美国风湿病学会建议先不吃降尿酸药。24 个人吃满 3 年，才拦得住一次痛风发作。想靠它护肾也落…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/06"},"children":["阅读整个主题：反面清单"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":